Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:09.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is another very, very special day{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是无比特别的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.14,0:00:13.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Valentin Vacherot. He’s the Basel champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗 他是巴塞尔冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:17.07,TL,,0,0,0,,从世界第{\fs78}204{\fs68} 到大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.07,0:00:19.68,TL,,0,0,0,,上海让人记住了瓦舍罗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.19,TL,,0,0,0,,可奖杯之后的一年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:22.84,TL,,0,0,0,,还有伤停 失利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:25.57,TL,,0,0,0,,也有重新打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.90,TL,,0,0,0,,去年{\fs78}10{\fs68}月 从资格赛出发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:32.08,TL,,0,0,0,,连赢{\fs78}9{\fs68}场 {\fs78}6{\fs68}次先丢一盘后逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:34.50,TL,,0,0,0,,最后 他击败表哥林德克内希
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:37.56,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次捧起巡回赛冠军奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:48.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match, Vacherot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 瓦舍罗获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:49.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two sets to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大比分二比一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.19,0:00:57.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Valentin Vacherot puts the icing on the cake to a fairy tale week in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗为上海童话画下圆满句号
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:04.60,TL,,0,0,0,,上海之后的下一站 就是巴塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.12,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮面对弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:09.01,TL,,0,0,0,,瓦舍罗先赢一盘 却被逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:12.15,TL,,0,0,0,,冠军之后 比赛没有变得容易
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.31,0:01:14.48,TL,,0,0,0,,接着来到巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:16.47,TL,,0,0,0,,他又赢了表哥林德克内希
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:19.09,TL,,0,0,0,,再过诺里 最终打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.09,0:01:20.42,TL,,0,0,0,,那一年结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:23.39,TL,,0,0,0,,他的世界排名是第{\fs78}31{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.55,0:01:25.50,TL,,0,0,0,,今年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.73,TL,,0,0,0,,他第一次打进大满贯第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:29.71,TL,,0,0,0,,随后输给谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.87,0:01:33.74,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月 回到家乡蒙特卡洛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:35.11,TL,,0,0,0,,他击败德米纳尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:36.69,TL,,0,0,0,,再进大师赛{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:38.88,TL,,0,0,0,,也进入了世界前{\fs78}20{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:40.08,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次捧杯之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:41.63,TL,,0,0,0,,他又一次在大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.63,0:01:44.05,TL,,0,0,0,,走到了最后一个周末
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:48.32,TL,,0,0,0,,但{\fs78}5{\fs68}月 左脚伤让赛程停了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:49.88,TL,,0,0,0,,法网赢过首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:52.37,TL,,0,0,0,,他却在第二轮开赛前退出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.37,0:01:54.77,TL,,0,0,0,,随后 也错过了温网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:01:56.02,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}5{\fs68}月到{\fs78}7{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.29,TL,,0,0,0,,近两个月没有正式比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:01:59.90,TL,,0,0,0,,下一次走上赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:02.18,TL,,0,0,0,,要等到格施塔德
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:06.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}月{\fs78}15{\fs68}日 复出首战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:09.42,TL,,0,0,0,,他在先丢一盘后 逆转汉夫曼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:13.31,TL,,0,0,0,,能回来比赛了 成绩却没有立刻稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:16.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月成都 作为头号种子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:18.01,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮轮空后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:21.34,TL,,0,0,0,,他第一场就输给资格赛球员哈里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:24.98,TL,,0,0,0,,到了东京 他又逆转西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:27.67,TL,,0,0,0,,击败菲斯 重新打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.67,0:02:30.79,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 莱赫奇卡挡住了他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:32.98,TL,,0,0,0,,再回上海
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:35.30,TL,,0,0,0,,这次他不用等一个资格赛位置
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.41,TL,,0,0,0,,直接以种子身份出场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:39.75,TL,,0,0,0,,可卫冕之旅止步第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:42.57,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 输给保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.57,0:02:44.22,TL,,0,0,0,,去年的奖杯还在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:47.39,TL,,0,0,0,,今天的比赛 仍然要从头打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.55,0:02:50.49,TL,,0,0,0,,然后 是巴塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:51.67,TL,,0,0,0,,先过纳沃内
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:54.46,TL,,0,0,0,,再用两次抢七闯过霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:58.44,TL,,0,0,0,,对鲁内 {\fs78}10{\fs68}个破发点 他化解了{\fs78}9{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.59,0:03:01.99,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 再遇弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:04.94,TL,,0,0,0,,去年在这里 瓦舍罗输给了他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:06.81,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 瓦舍罗赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:09.77,TL,,0,0,0,,终于再次打进巡回赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:22.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Valentin Vacherot blasts his way into the final in Basel.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗强势挺进巴塞尔决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:23.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a finish!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么漂亮的收尾！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:28.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It’s been a special shot this week, that backhand.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周 他的反手表现非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:30.37,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对手莱赫奇卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:33.55,TL,,0,0,0,,不到一个月前 刚在东京击败过他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:35.87,TL,,0,0,0,,这次 又是先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:39.19,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}之后 瓦舍罗连拿两个{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:41.79,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一分 交给现场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:07.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is another very, very special day{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是无比特别的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:11.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Valentin Vacherot. He’s the Basel champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗 他是巴塞尔冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:15.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What an achievement!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么了不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.61,0:04:19.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A second ATP title after Shanghai last year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N上海之后 第二座巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:28.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}His first at ATP 500 level, and makes a bit of history.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首座{\fs78}ATP500{\fs68}冠军 写下历史
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:31.10,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次夺冠 和跌跌撞撞后再捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:33.19,TL,,0,0,0,,哪一次更打动你？
